edium shark, velociraptor, warpony, dire badger, dire bat, dire weasel, monitor lizard; aquatic only: hippocampus, porpoise, sea tiger, sharks, sea cat. (Offered here: the creatures in the core data; it replaces nothing.)
Sword of Celestia	KEY:Paladin ACF ~ Sword of Celestia (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.PaladinACF.PaladinSpecialMount	PRECLASS:1,Paladin=5	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Sword of Celestia (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.447	DESC:Alternative class feature (paladin, 5th level). Celestial weaponsmiths forge a weapon of a kind you choose (such as longsword), which you must name and are bound by oath never to sell, give or loan. You can summon it to your hand or return it as a free action, even after being disarmed, %1 times per day (1 + Wisdom modifier, minimum 1). It is a +1 weapon at 5th level, +2 at 10th, +2 holy at 15th and +2 holy lawful at 20th; it overcomes damage reduction as if good-aligned, healing magic repairs it as a living creature, and you may enhance it as if you had Craft Magic Arms and Armor. If destroyed, a new one is presented a year and a day later. Replaces the special mount.
Sword of Celestia	KEY:ACF ~ Sword of Celestia (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.447	DESC:Celestial weaponsmiths forge a weapon of a kind you choose (such as longsword), which you must name and are bound by oath never to sell, give or loan. You can summon it to your hand or return it as a free action, even after being disarmed, %1 times per day (1 + Wisdom modifier, minimum 1). It is a +1 weapon at 5th level, +2 at 10th, +2 holy at 15th and +2 holy lawful at 20th; it overcomes damage reduction as if good-aligned, healing magic repairs it as a living creature, and you may enhance it as if you had Craft Magic Arms and Armor. If destroyed, a new one is presented a year and a day later. Replaces the special mount.|max(1,1+WIS)
Warded Special Mount	KEY:Paladin ACF ~ Warded Special Mount (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.PaladinACF.PaladinWardedMount	PRECLASS:1,Paladin=6	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Warded Special Mount (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.449	DESC:Alternative class feature (paladin, 6th level). Lightbringer paladin: in addition to its standard qualities, his special mount is immune to all death spells, magical death effects, energy drain and any negative energy effects (such as inflict spells or chill touch). Replaces one weekly use of remove disease (reduce the uses by hand).
Warded Special Mount	KEY:ACF ~ Warded Special Mount (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.449	DESC:Lightbringer paladin: in addition to its standard qualities, his special mount is immune to all death spells, magical death effects, energy drain and any negative energy effects (such as inflict spells or chill touch). Replaces one weekly use of remove disease (reduce the uses by hand).
